window.ELEMENTA_I18N={"fr":{"brand.name":"Elementa Expériences","brand.aria":"Elementa Expériences, retour à l’accueil","a11y.skip":"Aller au contenu","a11y.mainNav":"Navigation principale","a11y.menu":"Menu","a11y.close":"Fermer","lang.short":"EN","lang.long":"English","lang.aria":"Switch to English","nav.cabins":"Cabines","nav.experience":"L’expérience","nav.story":"Notre histoire","nav.gallery":"Galerie","nav.location":"Localisation","nav.faq":"FAQ","nav.privacy":"Confidentialité","nav.mind":"La Mentalité Elementa","nav.plan":"Planifier votre séjour","meta.home.title":"Elementa | Cabines de montagne à Sainte-Béatrix","meta.home.desc":"Découvrez Elementa à Sainte-Béatrix, dans Lanaudière : des cabines de montagne avec circuit thermal privé, terrasse sur le toit et séjour personnalisé.","meta.cabins.title":"Cabines de montagne | Elementa","meta.cabins.desc":"Deux étages ouverts sur la forêt, perchés à flanc de falaise : lit king, foyer à bois, cuisine, bain vapeur, douche extérieure et terrasse sur le toit.","meta.mind.title":"La Mentalité Elementa | Elementa","meta.mind.desc":"Âme, corps et esprit : prendre le temps de respirer, de bouger et de retrouver son rythme, au contact de la nature de Sainte-Béatrix.","meta.story.title":"Notre histoire | Elementa","meta.story.desc":"La recherche du site, l’intégration dans la nature, la cocréation avec les gens d’ici et les personnes derrière Elementa.","meta.faq.title":"Questions fréquentes | Elementa","meta.faq.desc":"Localisation, accès toute l’année, circuit thermal privé, équipements des cabines et planification du séjour : les réponses aux questions fréquentes.","meta.gallery.title":"Galerie | Elementa","meta.gallery.desc":"Toutes les photos des cabines de montagne Elementa à Sainte-Béatrix : architecture, chambre, foyer, bain vapeur, terrasse et matières.","meta.privacy.title":"Politique de confidentialité | Elementa","meta.privacy.desc":"Comment Elementa recueille et utilise les renseignements transmis par le formulaire de planification de séjour.","hero.eyebrow":"Sainte-Béatrix · Lanaudière","hero.title":"Loin du bruit, près de soi.","hero.desc":"Des cabines de montagne, un circuit thermal privé et une attention portée à chaque détail de votre séjour.","hero.plan":"Planifier votre séjour","hero.visit":"Visiter la cabine","hero.discover":"Découvrir le lieu","hero.pause":"Pause","hero.play":"Lire","hero.pauseAria":"Mettre l’extrait vidéo en pause","hero.playAria":"Lire l’extrait vidéo","hero.mediaAria":"Extrait vidéo ambiant de la terrasse sur le toit, sans son","hero.posterAlt":"La terrasse sur le toit d’une cabine Elementa, au-dessus de la forêt de Sainte-Béatrix","hero.flourishAria":"Logo Elementa","lieu.eyebrow":"Le lieu","lieu.title":"La nature, jusque dans les détails.","lieu.lead":"À Sainte-Béatrix, dans Lanaudière, Elementa vous accueille dans quatre cabines de montagne perchées à flanc de falaise. L’architecture, le circuit thermal privé et l’attention portée à vos préférences composent un séjour pensé pour vous permettre de ralentir.","lieu.f1b":"Sainte-Béatrix","lieu.f1":"Lanaudière, Québec","lieu.f2b":"Quatre cabines","lieu.f2":"de montagne, perchées à flanc de falaise","lieu.f3b":"Circuit thermal privé","lieu.f3":"bain vapeur et douche extérieure, dans chaque cabine","lieu.f4b":"Toute l’année","lieu.f4":"accessible aux quatre saisons","lieu.imgAlt":"Vue aérienne d’une cabine Elementa, un volume noir posé dans la forêt","lieu.imgCap":"Sainte-Béatrix, Lanaudière. La cabine vue du ciel.","cab.eyebrow":"Les cabines","cab.title":"Votre cabine de montagne.","cab.lead":"Deux étages ouverts sur la forêt, un lit king, un foyer à bois et une terrasse sur le toit. À l’intérieur comme à l’extérieur, chaque espace vous invite à prendre votre temps.","cab.layout":"Une seule pièce à vivre, pour deux : la chambre, le foyer et la cuisine au premier niveau ; la salle de bain vitrée et le bain vapeur à l’étage.","cab.l1":"Perchée à flanc de falaise, sur pilotis de plus de 10 pieds","cab.l2":"Circuit thermal privé : bain vapeur et douche extérieure","cab.l3":"Lit king","cab.l4":"Foyer à bois","cab.l5":"Planchers chauffants","cab.l6":"Cuisine équipée","cab.l7":"Rideaux électriques","cab.l8":"Terrasse sur le toit","cab.l9":"Accessible toute l’année","cab.more":"Découvrir les cabines","cab.equip":"Voir les équipements","cab.img1Alt":"La façade noire de la cabine et son hublot rond, au bord de la terrasse","cab.img1Cap":"L’extérieur, au bord de la falaise.","cab.img2Alt":"Plateau de bois et objets de laiton sur la table de la terrasse","cab.img2Cap":"Le détail des matières.","exp.eyebrow":"L’expérience","exp.title":"Trois moments du séjour.","exp.tablistAria":"Trois détails du séjour","exp.t1":"Le feu","exp.p1":"Le foyer à bois et les planchers chauffants prolongent le calme des journées en nature.","exp.alt1":"Le poêle à bois allumé devant les baies vitrées de la cabine","exp.t2":"La vapeur","exp.p2":"Composez votre circuit thermal privé entre bain vapeur, douche extérieure et repos sur la terrasse.","exp.alt2":"Le bain vapeur en pierre, sa douche pluie et son hublot rond","exp.t3":"Le toit-terrasse","exp.p3":"Au-dessus des arbres, un espace pour s’installer, regarder la montagne et laisser la journée se prolonger.","exp.alt3":"La terrasse sur le toit, ses chaises longues et la cheminée noire sous le ciel d’été","mind.eyebrow":"La Mentalité Elementa","mind.title":"Âme, corps et esprit.","mind.lead":"Prendre le temps de respirer, de bouger et de retrouver son rythme. La Mentalité Elementa place la connexion à la nature et l’attention à soi au cœur du séjour.","mind.more":"Découvrir la Mentalité Elementa","mind.alt":"La cime des arbres et la montagne vues de la terrasse","story.eyebrow":"Notre histoire","story.title":"Un lieu pensé avec les gens d’ici.","story.lead":"Elementa prend forme avec des artisans, des fournisseurs et des entrepreneurs locaux. Cette cocréation se retrouve dans l’architecture, les matières et les détails qui accompagnent votre séjour.","story.more":"Découvrir notre histoire","story.alt1":"Bois brut et cuisine sombre : les matières de la cabine","story.alt2":"Table en bois massif et cafetière en fonte sur la terrasse","story.alt3":"Chaise longue en bois clair sur la terrasse, face aux arbres","seasons.title":"Au rythme des saisons.","seasons.lead":"La lumière change. La forêt aussi. Elementa vous accueille toute l’année pour découvrir le lieu au fil des saisons.","seasons.alt":"La cabine noire et sa terrasse au-dessus de la forêt, sous un ciel d’été","gal.eyebrow":"Galerie","gal.title":"L’architecture, la matière, la lumière.","gal.all":"Toutes les photos","gal.openAria":"Agrandir la photo","gal.prev":"Photo précédente","gal.next":"Photo suivante","gal.close":"Fermer la galerie","gal.dialogAria":"Visionneuse de photos","gal.c1":"La chambre, ouverte sur la forêt","gal.c2":"Le foyer à bois","gal.c3":"Le bain vapeur","gal.c4":"La terrasse sur le toit","gal.c5":"Le hublot","gal.c6":"La cuisine","gal.c7":"La terrasse, au ras des arbres","gal.c8":"L’échelle vers le toit","loc.eyebrow":"Localisation","loc.title":"Sainte-Béatrix, dans Lanaudière.","loc.lead":"Au nord de Montréal, un site naturel et boisé où les cabines se cachent dans la forêt. L’adresse exacte et l’itinéraire vous sont transmis à la confirmation de votre séjour.","loc.d1":"Région","loc.v1":"Sainte-Béatrix, Lanaudière, Québec","loc.d2":"Accès","loc.v2":"Ouvert toute l’année, aux quatre saisons.","loc.d3":"Sur place","loc.v3":"Quatre cabines de montagne, chacune avec son circuit thermal privé et sa terrasse sur le toit.","loc.d4":"Le séjour","loc.v4":"Chaque séjour est préparé selon vos préférences. Indiquez-nous vos dates et vos envies : nous vous contacterons pour la suite.","loc.faq":"Consulter la FAQ","plan.eyebrow":"Planifier votre séjour","plan.title":"Votre prochain moment à vous.","plan.lead":"Indiquez vos dates et vos envies. Nous vous aiderons à préparer votre séjour à Elementa.","f.arrival":"Arrivée","f.departure":"Départ","f.guests":"Nombre de personnes","f.gChoose":"Choisir","f.g1":"1 personne","f.g2":"2 personnes","f.g3":"Plus de 2 personnes (plusieurs cabines)","f.name":"Nom","f.email":"Courriel","f.note":"Note","f.optional":"(facultatif)","f.notePh":"L’occasion, vos préférences, une question…","f.consent":"J’accepte de recevoir, à l’occasion, des nouvelles d’Elementa par courriel. Ce choix est facultatif et n’a aucune incidence sur ma demande.","f.submit":"Envoyer ma demande","f.sending":"Envoi en cours…","f.privacy":"En envoyant ce formulaire, vous acceptez notre <a href=\"confidentialite.html\">politique de confidentialité</a>. Aucun tarif ni aucune disponibilité n’est confirmé à cette étape.","f.e.required":"Ce champ est requis.","f.e.email":"Entrez une adresse courriel valide.","f.e.arrival":"Choisissez une date d’arrivée à venir.","f.e.departure":"Le départ doit suivre l’arrivée.","f.e.summary":"Veuillez corriger les champs indiqués.","f.ok":"Votre demande a bien été transmise. Notre équipe vous contactera pour préparer votre séjour.","f.fail":"Votre demande n’a pas pu être transmise. Vos informations sont conservées dans le formulaire : réessayez dans un instant.","f.unavailable":"La transmission en ligne des demandes n’est pas encore activée sur cette version du site. Vos informations restent dans le formulaire ; aucune demande n’a été envoyée.","tour.title":"Visiter la cabine","tour.aria":"Visite filmée de la cabine","tour.modesAria":"Mode de visite","tour.guided":"Lecture guidée","tour.manual":"À votre rythme","tour.close":"Fermer la visite","tour.plan":"Planifier votre séjour","tour.play":"Lire","tour.pause":"Pause","tour.startAria":"Lancer la visite","tour.range":"Progression de la visite","tour.hint":"Défilez pour avancer","tour.chaptersAria":"Chapitres","tour.end.title":"La visite est terminée.","tour.replay":"Revoir la visite","tour.cabins":"Découvrir les cabines","tour.unavailable":"La vidéo de la visite n’a pas pu être chargée. Vous pouvez poursuivre la découverte du lieu sur la page.","tour.posterAlt":"Vue aérienne de la cabine Elementa dans la forêt, début de la visite filmée","tour.ch1":"L’arrivée","tour.ch2":"La cabine","tour.ch3":"Le foyer","tour.ch4":"La cuisine","tour.ch5":"La terrasse","tour.ch6":"Le bain vapeur","tour.s1":"Au-dessus de la forêt","tour.s2":"Vers la cabine","tour.s3":"La chambre","tour.s4":"Le foyer","tour.s5":"La cuisine","tour.s6":"Le miroir rond","tour.s7":"L’échelle","tour.s8":"Vers le toit","tour.s9":"La terrasse sur le toit","tour.s10":"La cabine, vue du toit","tour.s11":"Le hublot","tour.s12":"Le bain vapeur","footer.tag":"Loin du bruit, près de soi.","footer.explore":"Explorer","footer.follow":"Suivre","footer.contact":"Contact","footer.location":"Sainte-Béatrix, Lanaudière, Québec","footer.planNote":"Pour un séjour, utilisez le formulaire de planification.","footer.media":"Demandes médias","footer.mediaNote":"Hamza Majdi, fondateur — journalistes et partenaires médias uniquement.","footer.copy":"© 2026 ELEMENTA EXPÉRIENCES. Tous droits réservés.","footer.top":"Haut de page","cabins.eyebrow":"Cabines de montagne","cabins.title":"Une cabine perchée, ouverte sur la forêt.","cabins.lead":"Quatre cabines de montagne, semblables dans leur architecture et installées chacune dans son propre coin de forêt. Deux niveaux, un circuit thermal privé et une terrasse sur le toit, pour deux.","cabins.s1.t":"À flanc de falaise","cabins.s1.p":"Posée sur des pilotis de plus de 10 pieds, la cabine s’avance au-dessus de la pente. Les murs vitrés cadrent les arbres ; le hublot rond regarde la montagne.","cabins.s1.alt":"La cabine noire vue de l’extérieur, avec son hublot rond","cabins.s2.t":"La chambre","cabins.s2.p":"Un lit king face à la forêt, des rideaux électriques pour choisir la lumière, des planchers chauffants sous les pieds dès le réveil.","cabins.s2.alt":"Le lit king devant les baies vitrées et la forêt","cabins.s3.t":"Le foyer à bois","cabins.s3.p":"Au centre de la pièce, le foyer à bois accompagne les soirées, du premier feu de l’automne aux nuits d’hiver.","cabins.s3.alt":"Le poêle à bois allumé, avec le bois rangé au sol","cabins.s4.t":"La cuisine","cabins.s4.p":"Une cuisine équipée, sombre et précise, pour préparer un café au lever du jour ou un repas à deux.","cabins.s4.alt":"La cuisine noire avec ses étagères et son plan de travail","cabins.s5.t":"Le bain vapeur","cabins.s5.p":"À l’étage, la salle de bain vitrée abrite le bain vapeur et sa douche pluie, avec le hublot ouvert sur les arbres. C’est le cœur de votre circuit thermal privé.","cabins.s5.alt":"Le bain vapeur en pierre et son hublot rond","cabins.s6.t":"La terrasse sur le toit","cabins.s6.p":"Une échelle mène au toit : chaises longues, douche extérieure et la montagne à hauteur des cimes.","cabins.s6.alt":"La terrasse sur le toit avec ses chaises longues sous le ciel d’été","cabins.s7.t":"Le hublot","cabins.s7.p":"Signature de la cabine, le hublot rond encadre la forêt depuis la chambre comme depuis le bain vapeur.","cabins.s7.alt":"Vue rapprochée du hublot rond ouvert sur la forêt","cabins.eq.eyebrow":"Les équipements","cabins.eq.title":"Ce que vous trouverez dans chaque cabine.","cabins.eq.g1":"L’espace à vivre","cabins.eq.g1.i1":"Lit king","cabins.eq.g1.i2":"Foyer à bois","cabins.eq.g1.i3":"Planchers chauffants","cabins.eq.g1.i4":"Rideaux électriques","cabins.eq.g1.i5":"Table à manger et coin salon","cabins.eq.g1.i6":"Salle d’eau au premier niveau","cabins.eq.g2":"La cuisine","cabins.eq.g2.i1":"Four et petit réfrigérateur","cabins.eq.g2.i2":"Lave-vaisselle et micro-ondes","cabins.eq.g2.i3":"Machine à café","cabins.eq.g2.i4":"Vaisselle, ustensiles et batterie de cuisine","cabins.eq.g3":"Le circuit thermal privé","cabins.eq.g3.i1":"Bain vapeur vitré, à l’étage","cabins.eq.g3.i2":"Douche pluie","cabins.eq.g3.i3":"Douche extérieure sur le toit","cabins.eq.g3.i4":"Terrasse sur le toit avec mobilier lounge","cabins.eq.g4":"Le confort","cabins.eq.g4.i1":"Wi-Fi","cabins.eq.g4.i2":"Haut-parleurs Bluetooth","cabins.eq.g4.i3":"Climatisation","cabins.eq.g4.i4":"Purificateur d’air et diffuseur d’huiles essentielles","cabins.eq.g4.i5":"Accès privé dans un site boisé","cabins.cta.title":"Prêt à choisir vos dates ?","cabins.cta.lead":"Indiquez vos dates et vos envies : nous préparerons votre séjour avec vous.","mindp.eyebrow":"La Mentalité Elementa","mindp.title":"Âme, corps et esprit.","mindp.lead":"La Mentalité Elementa est à l’origine du projet : une façon d’habiter le temps du séjour, en accord avec la nature qui l’entoure. Rien n’est imposé ; tout est là pour vous permettre de ralentir.","mindp.p1.t":"Respirer","mindp.p1.p":"L’air de la forêt, la vapeur du bain, la fraîcheur de la douche extérieure. Le circuit thermal privé rythme la journée, à votre manière.","mindp.p2.t":"Bouger","mindp.p2.p":"Marcher dans le site boisé, monter sur le toit, regarder la montagne. Le lieu invite au mouvement, sans horaire.","mindp.p3.t":"Retrouver son rythme","mindp.p3.p":"Se lever avec la lumière, lire près du feu, laisser la journée se prolonger. Le séjour est préparé selon vos préférences pour que le temps vous appartienne.","mindp.b1":"Chez Elementa, la nature n’est pas un décor : elle entre dans la cabine par les murs vitrés, le hublot et la terrasse sur le toit. Chaque espace est dessiné pour que le paysage nourrisse le corps autant que l’esprit.","mindp.b2":"La Mentalité Elementa ne promet rien d’autre que du temps, de l’attention et un lieu à la hauteur. À vous d’en faire un moment à votre image.","mindp.alt1":"La vue de la terrasse sur la forêt et la montagne","mindp.alt2":"Chaise longue en bois clair sur la terrasse, face aux arbres","storyp.eyebrow":"Notre histoire","storyp.title":"Un lieu pensé avec les gens d’ici.","storyp.lead":"Fièrement ancré au Québec, Elementa met en valeur la nature de Lanaudière à travers ses quatre saisons. Le projet prend forme avec des artisans, des fournisseurs et des entrepreneurs de la région.","storyp.b1.t":"La recherche du site","storyp.b1.p1":"Plus d’un an et demi a été consacré à la recherche du terrain idéal avant d’amorcer la construction : un site naturel et boisé, à Sainte-Béatrix, capable d’accueillir les cabines sans rien lui enlever.","storyp.b1.p2":"L’écosystème a été étudié pour implanter chaque cabine avec soin : le vent, le soleil, l’intimité de chacune, dissimulée dans la forêt tout en gardant la vue.","storyp.b1.alt":"Vue aérienne de la cabine dans la forêt de Sainte-Béatrix","storyp.b2.t":"Une architecture pour le lieu","storyp.b2.p1":"Les cabines de montagne sont perchées à flanc de falaise, sur pilotis de plus de 10 pieds. Leur architecture moderne est pensée pour mettre en valeur le lieu, pas pour s’y imposer.","storyp.b2.p2":"Les matières ont été choisies avec des artisans et des fournisseurs locaux : le bois, la pierre, le verre et le laiton composent un décor sobre qui laisse toute la place à la forêt.","storyp.b2.alt":"Bois brut et cuisine sombre : les matières de la cabine","storyp.b3.t":"La cocréation","storyp.b3.p":"Elementa se construit avec des partenaires qui partagent sa vision : des entrepreneurs et des artisans d’ici, qui grandissent avec le projet. Cette cocréation se retrouve dans l’architecture, les matières et les détails qui accompagnent votre séjour.","storyp.b3.alt":"Table en bois massif et cafetière en fonte sur la terrasse","storyp.people.t":"Les personnes derrière Elementa","storyp.h.name":"Hamza Majdi","storyp.h.role":"Fondateur","storyp.h.p":"Entrepreneur, Hamza Majdi est à l’origine d’Elementa et porte la vision du projet : une immersion en nature où l’exigence du détail fait toute la différence.","storyp.a.name":"Ali Diouri","storyp.a.role":"Partenaire d’affaires et cocréateur","storyp.a.p":"Spécialiste de l’immobilier au Québec, Ali Diouri accompagne le développement du projet et sa mise en marché.","storyp.proj.eyebrow":"Le projet","storyp.proj.t":"Elementa, aujourd’hui et demain.","storyp.proj.now.tag":"Aujourd’hui","storyp.proj.now.p":"Quatre cabines de montagne vous accueillent dès maintenant, chacune avec son circuit thermal privé et sa terrasse sur le toit, toute l’année.","storyp.proj.p1.tag":"Phase 1 — en développement","storyp.proj.p1.p":"La première phase prévoit 16 cabines de montagne au total, un pavillon d’accueil, un espace de réception, un bistro ainsi qu’un pavillon de soins et de loisirs. Ces installations sont planifiées et ne sont pas encore ouvertes.","storyp.proj.vis.tag":"Vision à long terme","storyp.proj.vis.p":"À plus long terme, Elementa envisage de grandir jusqu’à 60 habitations, avec un spa de plus grande envergure. Aucune échéance n’est annoncée.","storyp.occ.t":"Retraites, résidences de création, célébrations","storyp.occ.p":"Le lieu est pensé pour accueillir, à terme, des retraites corporatives et bien-être, des résidences d’artistes et des mariages intimes. Si vous préparez une occasion de ce type, écrivez-nous : nous vous dirons ce qui est possible aujourd’hui et ce qui s’en vient.","storyp.occ.cta":"Nous écrire","faq.eyebrow":"FAQ","faq.title":"Questions fréquentes.","faq.lead":"Ce qu’il faut savoir avant de planifier votre séjour. Pour toute autre question, écrivez-nous depuis le formulaire.","faq.q1":"Où se trouve Elementa ?","faq.a1":"Elementa est situé à Sainte-Béatrix, dans Lanaudière, au Québec, sur un site naturel et boisé au nord de Montréal. L’adresse exacte et l’itinéraire vous sont transmis à la confirmation de votre séjour.","faq.q2":"Elementa est-il ouvert toute l’année ?","faq.a2":"Oui. Les cabines sont accessibles aux quatre saisons, avec le foyer à bois et les planchers chauffants pour les mois froids.","faq.q3":"Qu’est-ce que le circuit thermal privé ?","faq.a3":"Chaque cabine dispose de son propre bain vapeur vitré et d’une douche extérieure sur la terrasse du toit. Vous composez votre circuit — chaleur, fraîcheur, repos — à votre rythme, sans le partager.","faq.q4":"Que trouve-t-on dans une cabine ?","faq.a4":"Deux niveaux ouverts sur la forêt : un lit king, un foyer à bois, des planchers chauffants, des rideaux électriques et une cuisine équipée au premier niveau ; la salle de bain vitrée avec le bain vapeur à l’étage ; une terrasse sur le toit avec douche extérieure. <a href=\"cabines.html#equipements\">Voir la liste des équipements</a>.","faq.q5":"Combien de cabines y a-t-il ?","faq.a5":"Quatre cabines de montagne sont disponibles dès maintenant. Elles constituent la première étape d’un projet plus large ; les installations futures sont présentées comme telles sur la page <a href=\"histoire.html#projet\">Notre histoire</a>.","faq.q6":"Comment planifier un séjour ?","faq.a6":"Indiquez vos dates, le nombre de personnes et vos envies dans le <a href=\"./#planifier\">formulaire de planification</a>. Notre équipe vous contactera pour préparer votre séjour et en confirmer les modalités.","faq.q7":"Peut-on organiser une retraite ou un mariage ?","faq.a7":"Le lieu est pensé pour accueillir, à terme, des retraites et des célébrations intimes. Les installations de réception sont en développement. Écrivez-nous pour discuter de ce qui est possible aujourd’hui.","faq.q8":"Comment joindre l’équipe pour une demande média ?","faq.a8":"Les demandes des journalistes et partenaires médias sont traitées par Hamza Majdi, fondateur : <a href=\"mailto:hamza@hamzamajdi.com\">hamza@hamzamajdi.com</a>. Cette adresse est réservée aux médias ; pour un séjour, utilisez le formulaire.","faq.more.t":"Une autre question ?","faq.more.p":"Les modalités pratiques de votre séjour — heures d’arrivée, conditions, préférences — vous sont confirmées directement par notre équipe.","faq.more.cta":"Nous écrire","galp.eyebrow":"Galerie","galp.title":"Toutes les photos.","galp.lead":"Les cabines de montagne, photographiées à Sainte-Béatrix.","galp.c1":"La cabine vue du ciel","galp.c2":"La façade et le hublot","galp.c3":"La chambre, ouverte sur la forêt","galp.c4":"Le lit king","galp.c5":"Le lit, depuis la terrasse","galp.c6":"Le foyer à bois","galp.c7":"La cuisine","galp.c8":"Bois brut et cuisine sombre","galp.c9":"Le bain vapeur","galp.c10":"La douche et le hublot","galp.c11":"Le hublot","galp.c12":"Le hublot, de près","galp.c13":"L’échelle vers le toit","galp.c14":"L’échelle et le hublot","galp.c15":"Sous le toit","galp.c16":"La terrasse sur le toit","galp.c17":"La terrasse et la cheminée","galp.c18":"La vue depuis le toit","galp.c19":"La table de la terrasse","galp.c20":"La chaise longue","galp.c21":"La porte de la terrasse","galp.c22":"Le détail des matières","galp.c23":"Le cocon","galp.c24":"Vers la terrasse","galp.c25":"Le bain vapeur, à la fin de la visite","priv.eyebrow":"Confidentialité","priv.title":"Politique de confidentialité.","priv.lead":"Cette politique décrit les renseignements que nous recueillons lorsque vous utilisez ce site et la façon dont nous les utilisons.","priv.h1":"Renseignements recueillis","priv.p1":"Lorsque vous remplissez le formulaire de planification de séjour, nous recueillons vos dates, le nombre de personnes, votre nom, votre adresse courriel et, si vous le souhaitez, une note. Ces renseignements servent uniquement à préparer votre séjour et à vous répondre.","priv.h2":"Communications","priv.p2":"Nous ne vous envoyons des nouvelles d’Elementa par courriel que si vous avez coché la case prévue à cet effet. Ce consentement est distinct de votre demande de séjour et peut être retiré en tout temps.","priv.h3":"Conservation et partage","priv.p3":"Vos renseignements sont conservés le temps nécessaire au traitement de votre demande et à la préparation de votre séjour. Ils ne sont ni vendus ni partagés avec des tiers à des fins commerciales.","priv.h4":"Témoins et mesure d’audience","priv.p4":"Ce site n’utilise ni témoins publicitaires ni outil de mesure d’audience. Votre choix de langue est conservé dans votre navigateur uniquement.","priv.h5":"Vos droits","priv.p5":"Vous pouvez demander l’accès, la correction ou la suppression de vos renseignements en nous écrivant depuis le formulaire du site et en précisant votre demande.","priv.updated":"Dernière mise à jour : septembre 2026.","nav.cabinsPage":"Les cabines en détail"},"en":{"brand.name":"Elementa Experiences","brand.aria":"Elementa Experiences, back to the homepage","a11y.skip":"Skip to content","a11y.mainNav":"Main navigation","a11y.menu":"Menu","a11y.close":"Close","lang.short":"FR","lang.long":"Français","lang.aria":"Passer en français","nav.cabins":"Cabins","nav.experience":"The experience","nav.story":"Our story","nav.gallery":"Gallery","nav.location":"Location","nav.faq":"FAQ","nav.privacy":"Privacy","nav.mind":"The Elementa Mentality","nav.plan":"Plan your stay","meta.home.title":"Elementa | Mountain cabins in Sainte-Béatrix","meta.home.desc":"Discover Elementa in Sainte-Béatrix, Lanaudière: mountain cabins with a private thermal circuit, a rooftop terrace and a personalized stay.","meta.cabins.title":"Mountain cabins | Elementa","meta.cabins.desc":"Two levels open to the forest, perched on the cliffside: king bed, wood-burning fireplace, kitchen, steam bath, outdoor shower and rooftop terrace.","meta.mind.title":"The Elementa Mentality | Elementa","meta.mind.desc":"Soul, body and mind: taking the time to breathe, to move and to find your rhythm again, in the nature of Sainte-Béatrix.","meta.story.title":"Our story | Elementa","meta.story.desc":"Finding the site, settling into nature, co-creating with local people, and the people behind Elementa.","meta.faq.title":"Frequently asked questions | Elementa","meta.faq.desc":"Location, year-round access, the private thermal circuit, cabin amenities and how to plan a stay: answers to frequent questions.","meta.gallery.title":"Gallery | Elementa","meta.gallery.desc":"All photos of the Elementa mountain cabins in Sainte-Béatrix: architecture, bedroom, fireplace, steam bath, terrace and materials.","meta.privacy.title":"Privacy policy | Elementa","meta.privacy.desc":"How Elementa collects and uses the information sent through the stay-planning form.","hero.eyebrow":"Sainte-Béatrix · Lanaudière","hero.title":"Far from the noise, close to yourself.","hero.desc":"Mountain cabins, a private thermal circuit and attention to every detail of your stay.","hero.plan":"Plan your stay","hero.visit":"Tour the cabin","hero.discover":"Discover the place","hero.pause":"Pause","hero.play":"Play","hero.pauseAria":"Pause the video excerpt","hero.playAria":"Play the video excerpt","hero.mediaAria":"Ambient video excerpt of the rooftop terrace, silent","hero.posterAlt":"The rooftop terrace of an Elementa cabin above the Sainte-Béatrix forest","hero.flourishAria":"Elementa logo","lieu.eyebrow":"The place","lieu.title":"Nature, down to the details.","lieu.lead":"In Sainte-Béatrix, in Lanaudière, Elementa welcomes you in four mountain cabins perched on a cliffside. The architecture, the private thermal circuit and the attention paid to your preferences make up a stay designed to let you slow down.","lieu.f1b":"Sainte-Béatrix","lieu.f1":"Lanaudière, Québec","lieu.f2b":"Four cabins","lieu.f2":"mountain cabins perched on a cliffside","lieu.f3b":"Private thermal circuit","lieu.f3":"steam bath and outdoor shower, in every cabin","lieu.f4b":"Year-round","lieu.f4":"open in all four seasons","lieu.imgAlt":"Aerial view of an Elementa cabin, a black volume set in the forest","lieu.imgCap":"Sainte-Béatrix, Lanaudière. The cabin seen from above.","cab.eyebrow":"The cabins","cab.title":"Your mountain cabin.","cab.lead":"Two levels open to the forest, a king bed, a wood-burning fireplace and a rooftop terrace. Inside and out, every space invites you to take your time.","cab.layout":"A single open living space, for two: the bedroom, the fireplace and the kitchen on the first level; the glass bathroom and the steam bath upstairs.","cab.l1":"Perched on the cliffside, on stilts more than 10 feet high","cab.l2":"Private thermal circuit: steam bath and outdoor shower","cab.l3":"King bed","cab.l4":"Wood-burning fireplace","cab.l5":"Heated floors","cab.l6":"Equipped kitchen","cab.l7":"Electric curtains","cab.l8":"Rooftop terrace","cab.l9":"Open all year round","cab.more":"Discover the cabins","cab.equip":"See the amenities","cab.img1Alt":"The cabin’s black facade and round porthole at the edge of the terrace","cab.img1Cap":"Outside, at the edge of the cliff.","cab.img2Alt":"Wooden tray and brass objects on the terrace table","cab.img2Cap":"The detail in the materials.","exp.eyebrow":"The experience","exp.title":"Three moments of the stay.","exp.tablistAria":"Three details of the stay","exp.t1":"The fire","exp.p1":"The wood-burning fireplace and the heated floors extend the calm of days spent in nature.","exp.alt1":"The lit wood stove in front of the cabin’s glass walls","exp.t2":"The steam","exp.p2":"Compose your private thermal circuit between the steam bath, the outdoor shower and rest on the terrace.","exp.alt2":"The stone steam bath, its rain shower and its round porthole","exp.t3":"The rooftop terrace","exp.p3":"Above the trees, a place to settle in, look at the mountain and let the day linger.","exp.alt3":"The rooftop terrace, its loungers and the black chimney under a summer sky","mind.eyebrow":"The Elementa Mentality","mind.title":"Soul, body and mind.","mind.lead":"Taking the time to breathe, to move and to find your rhythm again. The Elementa Mentality places connection with nature and attention to oneself at the heart of the stay.","mind.more":"Discover the Elementa Mentality","mind.alt":"Treetops and the mountain seen from the terrace","story.eyebrow":"Our story","story.title":"A place designed with local people.","story.lead":"Elementa takes shape with local artisans, suppliers and entrepreneurs. This co-creation shows in the architecture, the materials and the details that accompany your stay.","story.more":"Discover our story","story.alt1":"Raw wood and dark kitchen: the cabin’s materials","story.alt2":"Solid wood table and cast-iron kettle on the terrace","story.alt3":"Light wood lounger on the terrace, facing the trees","seasons.title":"With the rhythm of the seasons.","seasons.lead":"The light changes. So does the forest. Elementa welcomes you all year round to discover the place through the seasons.","seasons.alt":"The black cabin and its terrace above the forest under a summer sky","gal.eyebrow":"Gallery","gal.title":"Architecture, material, light.","gal.all":"All photos","gal.openAria":"Enlarge the photo","gal.prev":"Previous photo","gal.next":"Next photo","gal.close":"Close the gallery","gal.dialogAria":"Photo viewer","gal.c1":"The bedroom, open to the forest","gal.c2":"The wood-burning fireplace","gal.c3":"The steam bath","gal.c4":"The rooftop terrace","gal.c5":"The porthole","gal.c6":"The kitchen","gal.c7":"The terrace, level with the trees","gal.c8":"The ladder to the roof","loc.eyebrow":"Location","loc.title":"Sainte-Béatrix, in Lanaudière.","loc.lead":"North of Montréal, a natural wooded site where the cabins hide in the forest. The exact address and directions are sent to you when your stay is confirmed.","loc.d1":"Region","loc.v1":"Sainte-Béatrix, Lanaudière, Québec","loc.d2":"Access","loc.v2":"Open all year, in all four seasons.","loc.d3":"On site","loc.v3":"Four mountain cabins, each with its private thermal circuit and rooftop terrace.","loc.d4":"The stay","loc.v4":"Every stay is prepared around your preferences. Tell us your dates and wishes and we will contact you for the next step.","loc.faq":"Read the FAQ","plan.eyebrow":"Plan your stay","plan.title":"Your next moment for yourself.","plan.lead":"Tell us your dates and your wishes. We will help you prepare your stay at Elementa.","f.arrival":"Arrival","f.departure":"Departure","f.guests":"Number of guests","f.gChoose":"Choose","f.g1":"1 guest","f.g2":"2 guests","f.g3":"More than 2 guests (several cabins)","f.name":"Name","f.email":"Email","f.note":"Note","f.optional":"(optional)","f.notePh":"The occasion, your preferences, a question…","f.consent":"I agree to occasionally receive news from Elementa by email. This choice is optional and does not affect my request.","f.submit":"Send my request","f.sending":"Sending…","f.privacy":"By sending this form you accept our <a href=\"confidentialite.html\">privacy policy</a>. No rate or availability is confirmed at this stage.","f.e.required":"This field is required.","f.e.email":"Enter a valid email address.","f.e.arrival":"Choose an upcoming arrival date.","f.e.departure":"Departure must come after arrival.","f.e.summary":"Please correct the highlighted fields.","f.ok":"Your request has been sent. Our team will contact you to prepare your stay.","f.fail":"Your request could not be sent. Your details are kept in the form: please try again in a moment.","f.unavailable":"Online submission is not yet enabled on this version of the site. Your details stay in the form; no request has been sent.","tour.title":"Tour the cabin","tour.aria":"Filmed tour of the cabin","tour.modesAria":"Tour mode","tour.guided":"Guided playback","tour.manual":"At your own pace","tour.close":"Close the tour","tour.plan":"Plan your stay","tour.play":"Play","tour.pause":"Pause","tour.startAria":"Start the tour","tour.range":"Tour progress","tour.hint":"Scroll to move forward","tour.chaptersAria":"Chapters","tour.end.title":"The tour is over.","tour.replay":"Watch again","tour.cabins":"Discover the cabins","tour.unavailable":"The tour video could not be loaded. You can keep discovering the place on the page.","tour.posterAlt":"Aerial view of the Elementa cabin in the forest, start of the filmed tour","tour.ch1":"The arrival","tour.ch2":"The cabin","tour.ch3":"The fireplace","tour.ch4":"The kitchen","tour.ch5":"The terrace","tour.ch6":"The steam bath","tour.s1":"Above the forest","tour.s2":"Toward the cabin","tour.s3":"The bedroom","tour.s4":"The fireplace","tour.s5":"The kitchen","tour.s6":"The round mirror","tour.s7":"The ladder","tour.s8":"Up to the roof","tour.s9":"The rooftop terrace","tour.s10":"The cabin, seen from the roof","tour.s11":"The porthole","tour.s12":"The steam bath","footer.tag":"Far from the noise, close to yourself.","footer.explore":"Explore","footer.follow":"Follow","footer.contact":"Contact","footer.location":"Sainte-Béatrix, Lanaudière, Québec","footer.planNote":"For a stay, use the planning form.","footer.media":"Media enquiries","footer.mediaNote":"Hamza Majdi, founder — journalists and media partners only.","footer.copy":"© 2026 ELEMENTA EXPÉRIENCES. All rights reserved.","footer.top":"Back to top","cabins.eyebrow":"Mountain cabins","cabins.title":"A perched cabin, open to the forest.","cabins.lead":"Four mountain cabins, alike in their architecture and each set in its own corner of the forest. Two levels, a private thermal circuit and a rooftop terrace, for two.","cabins.s1.t":"On the cliffside","cabins.s1.p":"Set on stilts more than 10 feet high, the cabin reaches out over the slope. Glass walls frame the trees; the round porthole looks onto the mountain.","cabins.s1.alt":"The black cabin seen from outside, with its round porthole","cabins.s2.t":"The bedroom","cabins.s2.p":"A king bed facing the forest, electric curtains to choose the light, heated floors underfoot from the moment you wake.","cabins.s2.alt":"The king bed in front of the glass walls and the forest","cabins.s3.t":"The wood-burning fireplace","cabins.s3.p":"At the centre of the room, the wood-burning fireplace keeps the evenings company, from the first fire of autumn to winter nights.","cabins.s3.alt":"The lit wood stove, with firewood stored on the floor","cabins.s4.t":"The kitchen","cabins.s4.p":"An equipped kitchen, dark and precise, to make coffee at daybreak or a meal for two.","cabins.s4.alt":"The black kitchen with its shelves and worktop","cabins.s5.t":"The steam bath","cabins.s5.p":"Upstairs, the glass bathroom houses the steam bath and its rain shower, with the porthole open to the trees. It is the heart of your private thermal circuit.","cabins.s5.alt":"The stone steam bath and its round porthole","cabins.s6.t":"The rooftop terrace","cabins.s6.p":"A ladder leads to the roof: loungers, an outdoor shower and the mountain at treetop height.","cabins.s6.alt":"The rooftop terrace with its loungers under a summer sky","cabins.s7.t":"The porthole","cabins.s7.p":"The cabin’s signature, the round porthole frames the forest from the bedroom and from the steam bath alike.","cabins.s7.alt":"Close view of the round porthole open to the forest","cabins.eq.eyebrow":"The amenities","cabins.eq.title":"What you will find in every cabin.","cabins.eq.g1":"The living space","cabins.eq.g1.i1":"King bed","cabins.eq.g1.i2":"Wood-burning fireplace","cabins.eq.g1.i3":"Heated floors","cabins.eq.g1.i4":"Electric curtains","cabins.eq.g1.i5":"Dining table and lounge corner","cabins.eq.g1.i6":"Washroom on the first level","cabins.eq.g2":"The kitchen","cabins.eq.g2.i1":"Oven and small refrigerator","cabins.eq.g2.i2":"Dishwasher and microwave","cabins.eq.g2.i3":"Coffee machine","cabins.eq.g2.i4":"Dishes, utensils and cookware","cabins.eq.g3":"The private thermal circuit","cabins.eq.g3.i1":"Glass steam bath, upstairs","cabins.eq.g3.i2":"Rain shower","cabins.eq.g3.i3":"Outdoor shower on the roof","cabins.eq.g3.i4":"Rooftop terrace with lounge furniture","cabins.eq.g4":"Comfort","cabins.eq.g4.i1":"Wi-Fi","cabins.eq.g4.i2":"Bluetooth speakers","cabins.eq.g4.i3":"Air conditioning","cabins.eq.g4.i4":"Air purifier and essential-oil diffuser","cabins.eq.g4.i5":"Private access in a wooded site","cabins.cta.title":"Ready to choose your dates?","cabins.cta.lead":"Tell us your dates and your wishes: we will prepare your stay with you.","mindp.eyebrow":"The Elementa Mentality","mindp.title":"Soul, body and mind.","mindp.lead":"The Elementa Mentality is where the project began: a way of inhabiting the time of the stay, in tune with the nature around it. Nothing is imposed; everything is there to let you slow down.","mindp.p1.t":"Breathe","mindp.p1.p":"Forest air, the steam of the bath, the freshness of the outdoor shower. The private thermal circuit sets the pace of the day, your way.","mindp.p2.t":"Move","mindp.p2.p":"Walk the wooded site, climb up to the roof, look at the mountain. The place invites movement, with no schedule.","mindp.p3.t":"Find your rhythm","mindp.p3.p":"Rise with the light, read by the fire, let the day linger. The stay is prepared around your preferences so that time belongs to you.","mindp.b1":"At Elementa, nature is not a backdrop: it enters the cabin through the glass walls, the porthole and the rooftop terrace. Every space is designed so that the landscape nourishes body and mind alike.","mindp.b2":"The Elementa Mentality promises nothing more than time, attention and a place worthy of them. It is yours to turn into a moment of your own.","mindp.alt1":"The view from the terrace over the forest and the mountain","mindp.alt2":"Light wood lounger on the terrace, facing the trees","storyp.eyebrow":"Our story","storyp.title":"A place designed with local people.","storyp.lead":"Proudly rooted in Québec, Elementa showcases the nature of Lanaudière through its four seasons. The project takes shape with artisans, suppliers and entrepreneurs from the region.","storyp.b1.t":"Finding the site","storyp.b1.p1":"More than a year and a half went into finding the ideal land before construction began: a natural, wooded site in Sainte-Béatrix, able to welcome the cabins without taking anything away from it.","storyp.b1.p2":"The ecosystem was studied to place each cabin with care: wind, sun, and the privacy of each one, hidden in the forest while keeping the view.","storyp.b1.alt":"Aerial view of the cabin in the Sainte-Béatrix forest","storyp.b2.t":"An architecture for the place","storyp.b2.p1":"The mountain cabins are perched on the cliffside, on stilts more than 10 feet high. Their modern architecture is designed to showcase the place, not to impose on it.","storyp.b2.p2":"Materials were chosen with local artisans and suppliers: wood, stone, glass and brass make up a restrained décor that leaves all the room to the forest.","storyp.b2.alt":"Raw wood and dark kitchen: the cabin’s materials","storyp.b3.t":"Co-creation","storyp.b3.p":"Elementa is built with partners who share its vision: local entrepreneurs and artisans who grow with the project. This co-creation shows in the architecture, the materials and the details that accompany your stay.","storyp.b3.alt":"Solid wood table and cast-iron kettle on the terrace","storyp.people.t":"The people behind Elementa","storyp.h.name":"Hamza Majdi","storyp.h.role":"Founder","storyp.h.p":"An entrepreneur, Hamza Majdi is behind Elementa and carries the project’s vision: an immersion in nature where attention to detail makes all the difference.","storyp.a.name":"Ali Diouri","storyp.a.role":"Business partner and co-creator","storyp.a.p":"A real-estate specialist in Québec, Ali Diouri supports the project’s development and its go-to-market.","storyp.proj.eyebrow":"The project","storyp.proj.t":"Elementa, today and tomorrow.","storyp.proj.now.tag":"Today","storyp.proj.now.p":"Four mountain cabins welcome you now, each with its private thermal circuit and rooftop terrace, all year round.","storyp.proj.p1.tag":"Phase 1 — in development","storyp.proj.p1.p":"The first phase plans 16 mountain cabins in total, a welcome pavilion, a reception space, a bistro and a care and leisure pavilion. These facilities are planned and not yet open.","storyp.proj.vis.tag":"Long-term vision","storyp.proj.vis.p":"In the longer term, Elementa envisions growing to 60 homes, with a larger spa. No timeline has been announced.","storyp.occ.t":"Retreats, creative residencies, celebrations","storyp.occ.p":"The place is designed to host, in time, corporate and wellness retreats, artists’ residencies and intimate weddings. If you are preparing an occasion of this kind, write to us: we will tell you what is possible today and what is coming.","storyp.occ.cta":"Write to us","faq.eyebrow":"FAQ","faq.title":"Frequently asked questions.","faq.lead":"What you need to know before planning your stay. For anything else, write to us from the form.","faq.q1":"Where is Elementa?","faq.a1":"Elementa is located in Sainte-Béatrix, in Lanaudière, Québec, on a natural wooded site north of Montréal. The exact address and directions are sent to you when your stay is confirmed.","faq.q2":"Is Elementa open all year?","faq.a2":"Yes. The cabins are accessible in all four seasons, with the wood-burning fireplace and heated floors for the cold months.","faq.q3":"What is the private thermal circuit?","faq.a3":"Each cabin has its own glass steam bath and an outdoor shower on the rooftop terrace. You compose your circuit — heat, cold, rest — at your own pace, without sharing it.","faq.q4":"What is in a cabin?","faq.a4":"Two levels open to the forest: a king bed, a wood-burning fireplace, heated floors, electric curtains and an equipped kitchen on the first level; the glass bathroom with the steam bath upstairs; a rooftop terrace with an outdoor shower. <a href=\"cabines.html#equipements\">See the list of amenities</a>.","faq.q5":"How many cabins are there?","faq.a5":"Four mountain cabins are available now. They are the first step of a larger project; future facilities are presented as such on the <a href=\"histoire.html#projet\">Our story</a> page.","faq.q6":"How do I plan a stay?","faq.a6":"Enter your dates, the number of guests and your wishes in the <a href=\"./#planifier\">planning form</a>. Our team will contact you to prepare your stay and confirm the details.","faq.q7":"Can we organize a retreat or a wedding?","faq.a7":"The place is designed to host retreats and intimate celebrations in time. The reception facilities are in development. Write to us to discuss what is possible today.","faq.q8":"How do I reach the team for a media enquiry?","faq.a8":"Enquiries from journalists and media partners are handled by Hamza Majdi, founder: <a href=\"mailto:hamza@hamzamajdi.com\">hamza@hamzamajdi.com</a>. This address is for media only; for a stay, use the form.","faq.more.t":"Another question?","faq.more.p":"The practical details of your stay — arrival times, conditions, preferences — are confirmed directly by our team.","faq.more.cta":"Write to us","galp.eyebrow":"Gallery","galp.title":"All photos.","galp.lead":"The mountain cabins, photographed in Sainte-Béatrix.","galp.c1":"The cabin seen from above","galp.c2":"The facade and the porthole","galp.c3":"The bedroom, open to the forest","galp.c4":"The king bed","galp.c5":"The bed, from the terrace","galp.c6":"The wood-burning fireplace","galp.c7":"The kitchen","galp.c8":"Raw wood and dark kitchen","galp.c9":"The steam bath","galp.c10":"The shower and the porthole","galp.c11":"The porthole","galp.c12":"The porthole, up close","galp.c13":"The ladder to the roof","galp.c14":"The ladder and the porthole","galp.c15":"Under the roof","galp.c16":"The rooftop terrace","galp.c17":"The terrace and the chimney","galp.c18":"The view from the roof","galp.c19":"The terrace table","galp.c20":"The lounger","galp.c21":"The terrace door","galp.c22":"The detail in the materials","galp.c23":"The cocoon","galp.c24":"Toward the terrace","galp.c25":"The steam bath, at the end of the tour","priv.eyebrow":"Privacy","priv.title":"Privacy policy.","priv.lead":"This policy describes the information we collect when you use this site and how we use it.","priv.h1":"Information collected","priv.p1":"When you fill in the stay-planning form, we collect your dates, the number of guests, your name, your email address and, if you wish, a note. This information is used only to prepare your stay and to reply to you.","priv.h2":"Communications","priv.p2":"We only send you news from Elementa by email if you have ticked the box provided for that purpose. This consent is separate from your stay request and can be withdrawn at any time.","priv.h3":"Retention and sharing","priv.p3":"Your information is kept for as long as needed to process your request and prepare your stay. It is neither sold nor shared with third parties for commercial purposes.","priv.h4":"Cookies and analytics","priv.p4":"This site uses neither advertising cookies nor audience measurement tools. Your language choice is stored in your browser only.","priv.h5":"Your rights","priv.p5":"You can request access to, correction or deletion of your information by writing to us from the site’s form and stating your request.","priv.updated":"Last updated: September 2026.","nav.cabinsPage":"The cabins in detail"}};
